  "question": {
    "text": "If the sum of the co-efficients of all the positive even powers of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> in the binomial expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi></math> is equal to _____.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "83",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>Binomial expression&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup></math>, so its&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;term is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>10</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mi>r</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>10</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>r</mi></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now putting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;and adding all term we get&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>10</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>30</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>10</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>1</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>26</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>7</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>10</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>8</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>10</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>8</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>10</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>10</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>30</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>10</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>1</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>26</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>7</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>10</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;both side we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>10</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>10</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>7</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>10</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mfenced><mn>83</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mtext>sum&#160;of&#160;even&#160;coefficients</mtext></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>83</mn></math></p>",
